# Security

- Never log full VLESS URLs, UUIDs, passwords, or sensitive params.
- Never send VLESS credentials to external services; only the public exit IP goes to GeoIP.
- Do not include credentials in output files (`results/`).
- Never commit `.env`, `configs.txt`, or `results/` — they are gitignored.
